        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/0ec41d78239e19639caeabc70e634097.poster.avif?t=1788114929\" width=1170 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/0ec41d78239e19639caeabc70e634097.webm?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > HydroTick is a unique gamified experience designed to help you drink more water throughout your day. Set your own reminder intervals, get notified when it’s time to take a sip, and earn in-game coins for every glass you drink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/94a163b5896e87eddfee8fe8f56278e7.poster.avif?t=1788114929\" width=1170 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/94a163b5896e87eddfee8fe8f56278e7.webm?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earned coins to buy extraordinary fish eggs, hatch them into stunning creatures, and decorate your personal aquarium just the way you like. Choose from a wide variety of plants, ornaments, and background styles to create the perfect aquatic retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/7b0ae0f661cdd0b0f3029281d204bd4f.poster.avif?t=1788114929\" width=1170 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/7b0ae0f661cdd0b0f3029281d204bd4f.webm?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Explorer may bring you exclusive decorations you can’t buy anywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fisherman can deliver ultra-rare fish to add to your collection.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/4d1f0fcae0f09034d74f7eacf5330d47.poster.avif?t=1788114929\" width=1170 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/4d1f0fcae0f09034d74f7eacf5330d47.webm?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not in the mood for aquarium care? HydroTick can still run as a water reminder in the background. Enjoy a calming atmosphere with focus-boosting ambient noise and soothing music — perfect for working, studying, or simply unwinding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/bce108f6c021aff519bc2fca4642526d.poster.avif?t=1788114929\" width=1170 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/bce108f6c021aff519bc2fca4642526d.webm?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable water drinking reminders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin rewards for every drink logged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and hatch uniquely designed fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your aquarium with rare items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special characters bringing exclusive content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing ambient sounds and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community to contribute your own designs to the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game and gain tradable items in your Steam inventory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HydroTick isn’t just a game, it’s your daily hydration companion and a relaxing aquatic escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/1be6d9a878a4cc54e519e78a32633b66.poster.avif?t=1788114929\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/1be6d9a878a4cc54e519e78a32633b66.webm?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/1be6d9a878a4cc54e519e78a32633b66.mp4?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/0ec41d78239e19639caeabc70e634097.poster.avif?t=1788114929\" width=1170 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/0ec41d78239e19639caeabc70e634097.webm?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > HydroTick is a unique gamified experience designed to help you drink more water throughout your day. Set your own reminder intervals, get notified when it’s time to take a sip, and earn in-game coins for every glass you drink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/94a163b5896e87eddfee8fe8f56278e7.poster.avif?t=1788114929\" width=1170 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/94a163b5896e87eddfee8fe8f56278e7.webm?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earned coins to buy extraordinary fish eggs, hatch them into stunning creatures, and decorate your personal aquarium just the way you like. Choose from a wide variety of plants, ornaments, and background styles to create the perfect aquatic retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/7b0ae0f661cdd0b0f3029281d204bd4f.poster.avif?t=1788114929\" width=1170 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/7b0ae0f661cdd0b0f3029281d204bd4f.webm?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Explorer may bring you exclusive decorations you can’t buy anywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fisherman can deliver ultra-rare fish to add to your collection.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/4d1f0fcae0f09034d74f7eacf5330d47.poster.avif?t=1788114929\" width=1170 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/4d1f0fcae0f09034d74f7eacf5330d47.webm?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not in the mood for aquarium care? HydroTick can still run as a water reminder in the background. Enjoy a calming atmosphere with focus-boosting ambient noise and soothing music — perfect for working, studying, or simply unwinding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/bce108f6c021aff519bc2fca4642526d.poster.avif?t=1788114929\" width=1170 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/bce108f6c021aff519bc2fca4642526d.webm?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable water drinking reminders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin rewards for every drink logged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and hatch uniquely designed fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your aquarium with rare items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special characters bringing exclusive content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing ambient sounds and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community to contribute your own designs to the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game and gain tradable items in your Steam inventory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HydroTick isn’t just a game, it’s your daily hydration companion and a relaxing aquatic escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/1be6d9a878a4cc54e519e78a32633b66.poster.avif?t=1788114929\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/1be6d9a878a4cc54e519e78a32633b66.webm?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939510/extras/1be6d9a878a4cc54e519e78a32633b66.mp4?t=1788114929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
